  "fixed_dialogue": [
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_01.intro",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "后巷还能走，先带人出去。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_001",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_01:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_01.complete",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "人都到齐了，先把火生起来。",
      "trigger": "任务真实条件完成且本人观察或允许回执成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_002",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_01:dialogue[1]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_02.intro",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "先把做工具的地方安好。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_003",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_02:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_02.complete",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "这回出门，回来就有地方修整了。",
      "trigger": "任务真实条件完成且本人观察或允许回执成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_004",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_02:dialogue[1]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_03.intro",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "前面有动静，先看清楚再过去。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_005",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_03:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_03.complete",
      "speaker": "族人",
      "text": "路我记得，等安全了就跟你们走。",
      "trigger": "任务真实条件完成且本人观察或允许回执成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_006",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_03:dialogue[1]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_04.intro",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "人回来了，营地也该往外腾一点。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_007",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_04:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_04.complete",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "下次出门，我们能多做些准备。",
      "trigger": "任务真实条件完成且本人观察或允许回执成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_008",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_04:dialogue[1]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_05.intro",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "营地安顿好了。沿渡口和山脊看清故乡入口，先给自己留条退路。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_009",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_05:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "TASK109_SYNC_WITH_APPROVED_CAMPAIGN",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_05.complete",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "入口记下了，怎么进去由你定。",
      "trigger": "任务真实条件完成且本人观察或允许回执成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_010",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_05:dialogue[1]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_06.intro",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "水岸、作坊、住区和议场的路不同，先看清一处，再决定下一步。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_011",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_06:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "TASK109_SYNC_WITH_APPROVED_CAMPAIGN",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_06.complete",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "两处旗帜都换了，剩下的路能走得更稳。",
      "trigger": "任务真实条件完成且本人观察或允许回执成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_012",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_06:dialogue[1]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_07.intro",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "四面旗帜都要确认，剩下的威胁也不能漏掉。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_013",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_07:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "TASK109_SYNC_WITH_APPROVED_CAMPAIGN",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_07.complete",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "这一次，火可以留在这里了。",
      "trigger": "任务真实条件完成且本人观察或允许回执成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_014",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_07:dialogue[1]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_08.intro",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "回来以后，把仓储和工作区用起来。今晚终于可以留在这里。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_015",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_08:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "TASK109_SYNC_WITH_APPROVED_CAMPAIGN",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.main_08.complete",
      "speaker": "弟弟",
      "text": "有两处落脚的地方，日子就能接着过。",
      "trigger": "任务真实条件完成且本人观察或允许回执成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_016",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:main_08:dialogue[1]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
    {
      "cue_id": "fixed.side_01.intro",
      "speaker": "族人",
      "text": "还有人留在里面，走的时候叫上我们。",
      "trigger": "任务已可接受且当前对话获知条件成立",
      "audio_group": "voice_quest_017",
      "source": "Resources/Data/gameplay.json:campaign.quests:side_01:dialogue[0]",
      "text_status": "CONFIRMED_049_TEXT_APPROVED_051_TRIGGER",
      "voice_status": "UNPRODUCED"
    },
